                                                "sense_id": "c312bca4-526c-3a41-9ca3-3c2c6d79b051",
                                                "text": "O thou bloody prison […] / Within the guilty closure of thy walls / Richard the Second here was hacked to death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
